            <div xml:id="d1415">

                <pb facs="1140" n="1130" xml:id="pg1130"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">125.9532: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Consul at Tsingtao</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Hawthorne</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1949-07-01T19:00:00-04:00">July 1, 1949—7 p.
                            m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>177. Dept assumes you have protested to local Aliens Affairs Office (urtel 302,
                    June 30). Shld attempt obtain receipt for such removals signed by officer
                    removing.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Acheson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
